186045443 true] [17592186550198 1074 "The diagram shows that the parabola has its vertex at $O,$ and passes through the point $(6,-3).$\n\nThe standard equation of a left- or right-opening parabola whose vertex is at $(0,0)$ is given by\n\n$$\n{y}^{2}=4px.\n$$\n\nSubstituting $x=6$ and $y=-3$ into the equation above, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(-3)^{2} & =4p(6) \\\\ 9 & =24p \\\\ p & =\\frac{3}{8}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the equation of our parabola is \n\n$$\n{y}^{2}=\\frac{3}{2}x.\n$$\n\nFinally, to calculate $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x},$ we use implicit differentiation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({y}^{2}) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\frac{3}{2}x) \\\\ 2y\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{3}{2} \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{3}{4y}\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535969 17592186045443 true] [17592186550199 1080 "y" 13194139535969 17592186045443 true] [17592186550199 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139535969 17592186045443 true] [17592186550199 1083 #uuid "d0179ef3-c580-5528-84e0-df55b78be308" 13194139535969 17592186045443 true] [17592186550200 1080 "\\frac{8}{y}" 13194139535969 17592186045443 true] [17592186550200 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139535969 17592186045443 true] [17592186550200 1083 #uuid "d2f3ef9c-8be7-525c-bc57-d1ce7659ff00" 13194139535969 17592186045443 true] [17592186550201 1068 #edb/ref 17592186550209 13194139535969 17592186045443 true] [17592186550201 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139535969 17592186045443 true] [17592186550201 1071 "![](images/03/03a879d7f79141f6816bf74a73efa87b089e2c213bc2b58bc93727cd8ee08500.png)\n\nThe parabola shown above has equation\n\n$$\n{y}^{2}=8x.\n$$\n\nFind $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}$ for the right-opening parabola shown above." 13194139535969 17592186045443 true] [17592186550201 1072 #uuid "d4eb74b6-db84-5116-8322-9b24d0326181" 13194139535969 17592186045443 true] [17592186550201 1074 "The equation of our parabola is \n\n$$\n{y}^{2}=8x.\n$$